<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Maintenance — {{ domain_name }}</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    .card {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 480px;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
    }
    h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    p { color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; }
    .retry { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #475569; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Under Maintenance</h1>
    <p>We're performing scheduled maintenance and will be back shortly.</p>
    <p class="retry">Please try again in a few minutes.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
